$ plumber config generate
exit: 2
--- stdout

--- stderr
Usage:
  plumber config generate [flags]

Flags:
  -f, --force           Overwrite existing file
  -h, --help            help for generate
  -o, --output string   Output file path (default ".plumber.yaml")
      --overlay         Write a minimal overlay starter (extends: plumber:default) instead of the full template

Global Flags:
  -v, --verbose   Enable debug logging on stderr (level=debug); replaces the progress bar

Error: file .plumber.yaml already exists. Use --force to overwrite

